{"automorphism_free_anywhere": false, "finding": "F18_F19_two_chart_freedoms", "rows": [{"aut_order": 4, "automorphism_action_free": false, "automorphism_fixed_points": 3, "group_order": 5, "holomorph_order": 20, "min_expected_aut_fixed_points": 3, "n": 5, "n_translations": 5, "translation_action_free": true, "translation_fixed_points": 0}, {"aut_order": 6, "automorphism_action_free": false, "automorphism_fixed_points": 5, "group_order": 7, "holomorph_order": 42, "min_expected_aut_fixed_points": 5, "n": 7, "n_translations": 7, "translation_action_free": true, "translation_fixed_points": 0}, {"aut_order": 4, "automorphism_action_free": false, "automorphism_fixed_points": 12, "group_order": 12, "holomorph_order": 48, "min_expected_aut_fixed_points": 3, "n": 12, "n_translations": 12, "translation_action_free": true, "translation_fixed_points": 0}, {"aut_order": 16, "automorphism_action_free": false, "automorphism_fixed_points": 15, "group_order": 17, "holomorph_order": 272, "min_expected_aut_fixed_points": 15, "n": 17, "n_translations": 17, "translation_action_free": true, "translation_fixed_points": 0}, {"aut_order": 18, "automorphism_action_free": false, "automorphism_fixed_points": 17, "group_order": 19, "holomorph_order": 342, "min_expected_aut_fixed_points": 17, "n": 19, "n_translations": 19, "translation_action_free": true, "translation_fixed_points": 0}, {"aut_order": 10, "automorphism_action_free": false, "automorphism_fixed_points": 18, "group_order": 22, "holomorph_order": 220, "min_expected_aut_fixed_points": 9, "n": 22, "n_translations": 22, "translation_action_free": true, "translation_fixed_points": 0}, {"aut_order": 8, "automorphism_action_free": false, "automorphism_fixed_points": 40, "group_order": 24, "holomorph_order": 192, "min_expected_aut_fixed_points": 7, "n": 24, "n_translations": 24, "translation_action_free": true, "translation_fixed_points": 0}, {"aut_order": 30, "automorphism_action_free": false, "automorphism_fixed_points": 29, "group_order": 31, "holomorph_order": 930, "min_expected_aut_fixed_points": 29, "n": 31, "n_translations": 31, "translation_action_free": true, "translation_fixed_points": 0}, {"aut_order": 40, "automorphism_action_free": false, "automorphism_fixed_points": 39, "group_order": 41, "holomorph_order": 1640, "min_expected_aut_fixed_points": 39, "n": 41, "n_translations": 41, "translation_action_free": true, "translation_fixed_points": 0}, {"aut_order": 52, "automorphism_action_free": false, "automorphism_fixed_points": 51, "group_order": 53, "holomorph_order": 2756, "min_expected_aut_fixed_points": 51, "n": 53, "n_translations": 53, "translation_action_free": true, "translation_fixed_points": 0}], "srmech_version": "0.9.0rc424", "translation_free_everywhere": true, "verdict": "THE TWO FREEDOMS ARE DIFFERENT IN KIND. The ORIGIN (clef) freedom is a free action at every n — no origin is distinguished, so it IS a torsor and 'a clef is an origin choice, not data' is exactly right. The RENAMING (Syn / automorphism) freedom is NOT free at any n: every non-identity automorphism fixes the identity element, so a renaming DOES distinguish a point. Conflating the two would have made the torsor claim false."}
{"affine_order": 48, "aut_order": 4, "finding": "F20_full_chart_freedom_group", "free": false, "modulus": 12, "multiplicity_histogram": {"4": 144}, "srmech_version": "0.9.0rc424", "transitive": true, "translation_subgroup_order": 12, "verdict": "The full chart-freedom group is the holomorph ℤ/n ⋊ Aut(ℤ/n) (the 1-dimensional affine group). It acts TRANSITIVELY but NOT FREELY, so it is not a torsor. The torsor is exactly the NORMAL TRANSLATION SUBGROUP. That is the precise sense in which 'a clef is an origin choice': the clef lives in the torsorial part, and the key/mode/renaming conventions live in the part that is not."}
